{"id":"constante","lemma":"constante","pos":"adj","rank":2742,"glosses":["constant (unchanged through time or space)","constant (consistently recurring over time)","constant (steady in purpose, action)"],"ipa":"/kõsˈtɐ̃.t͡ʃi/","forms":{"plural":"constantes"},"examples":[{"text":"A única coisa constante neste mundo é a mudança.","en":"The only thing constant in this world is change.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"unique","l":"único"},{"g":"thing"},null,null,{"g":"world"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"change"}]},{"text":"Tom fez um progresso constante.","en":"Tom made steady progress.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"progress"},null]},{"text":"Tom requer cuidados constantes.","en":"Tom requires constant care.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to require, need","l":"requerer"},{"g":"watch out!","l":"cuidado"},null]},{"text":"Estou farto dos seus sermões constantes.","en":"I'm fed up with him always preaching to me.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"stuffed"},null,{"g":"their or your kin"},{"g":"sermon","l":"sermão"},null]},{"text":"Os constantes resmungos de minha mulher estão me arrasando.","en":"My wife's constant nagging is getting me down.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"meu"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to raze, demolish","l":"arrasar"}]}]}